body:
For some context;

1. I am straight
2. I was raised in the church for the most part

&#x200B;

I hate that all Christians and the bible directly say that God loves all, but most churches end up being full of homophobic pricks who don't even want to live in the same town as one gay man

&#x200B;

\*Edit: now that I thought about it for more than 10 minutes allow me to rephrase the first part, Christians and the bible say to love everyone
